{"ayah/54-19.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Qamar 54:19 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Lalle Mũ, Mun aika da iska mai tsananin sauti a kansu, a cikin wani yinin nahĩsa mai dõgẽwa.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/54-19.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Qamar 54:19 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Lalle Mũ, Mun aika da iska mai tsananin sauti a kansu, a cikin wani yinin nahĩsa mai dõgẽwa.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Qamar\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/54.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 19\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-19.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/54.html\">Sura Al-Qamar</a> › Aya 19</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Qamar 54:19</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّا أَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ رِيحًا صَرْصَرًا فِي يَوْمِ نَحْسٍ مُّسْتَمِرٍّ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Lalle Mũ, Mun aika da iska mai tsananin sauti a kansu, a cikin wani yinin nahĩsa mai dõgẽwa.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وكان اليوم نحسا عليهم لإرسال العذاب عليهم أي لا يقلع عنهم<cite>«مفتاح دار السعادة ومنشور ولاية العلم والإرادة» 2/194</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ومستمر صفة للنحس لا لليوم<cite>«مفتاح دار السعادة ومنشور ولاية العلم والإرادة» 2/194</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فسعود الأيام ونحوسها إنما هو بسعود الأعمال وموافقتها لمرضاة الرب ونحوس الأعمال مخالفتها لما جاءت به الرسل واليوم الواحد يكون يوم سعد لطائفة ونحس لطائفه كما كان يوم بدر يوم سعد للمؤمنين ويوم نحس على الكافرين<cite>«مفتاح دار السعادة ومنشور ولاية العلم والإرادة» 2/194</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s54a19\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/ha/ayah/54-31.html\">Aya ta gaba (54:31)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/54-31.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Qamar 54:31 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Lalle Mũ, Mun aika tsãwa guda a kansu, sai suka kasance kamar yãyin mai shinge.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/54-31.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Qamar 54:31 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Lalle Mũ, Mun aika tsãwa guda a kansu, sai suka kasance kamar yãyin mai shinge.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Qamar\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/54.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 31\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-31.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/54.html\">Sura Al-Qamar</a> › Aya 31</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Qamar 54:31</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّا أَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ صَيْحَةً وَاحِدَةً فَكَانُوا كَهَشِيمِ الْمُحْتَظِرِ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Lalle Mũ, Mun aika tsãwa guda a kansu, sai suka kasance kamar yãyin mai shinge.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وكذلك قوله: {إنا أرسلنا عليهم صيحة واحدة} والتخلية بين المرسل وبين ما أرسل عليه من لوازم هذا المعنى ولا يتم التسليط إلا به فإذا أرسل الشيء الذي من طبعه وشأنه أن تفعل فعلا ولم تمنعه من فعله فهذا هو التسليط<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/63</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s54a31\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/54-19.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (54:19)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/54-43.html\">Aya ta gaba (54:43)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/54-43.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Qamar 54:43 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Shin, kãfiranku ne mafi alhẽri daga waɗancan, ko kuwa kunã da wata barã&#x27;a a cikin littattafai?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/54-43.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Qamar 54:43 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Shin, kãfiranku ne mafi alhẽri daga waɗancan, ko kuwa kunã da wata barã&#x27;a a cikin littattafai?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Qamar\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/54.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 43\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-43.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/54.html\">Sura Al-Qamar</a> › Aya 43</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Qamar 54:43</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿أَكُفَّارُكُمْ خَيْرٌ مِّنْ أُولَٰئِكُمْ أَمْ لَكُم بَرَاءَةٌ فِي الزُّبُرِ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Shin, kãfiranku ne mafi alhẽri daga waɗancan, ko kuwa kunã da wata barã&#x27;a a cikin littattafai?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">يقول: فإذا لم يكونوا خيرا منهم، فكيف ينجون من العذاب، مع مماثلتهم لهم<cite>«النبوات» 2/964</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ثم قال: {أم لكم براءة في الزبر} : أي معكم خبر من الله بأنه لا يعذبكم؟؛ فنفى الدليلين: العقلي، والسمعي،<cite>«النبوات» 2/964</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا محض تعدية الحكم إلى من عدا المذكورين بعموم العلة<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 1/102</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s54a43\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/54-31.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (54:31)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/54-45.html\">Aya ta gaba (54:45)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/54-45.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Qamar 54:45 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Zã a karya tãron, kuma su jũya bãya dõmin gudu.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"ht